WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
This needle is just a special kind of natural pearl

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,600
Because a total of two pills were found inside that big stick.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,300
The other one is slightly bigger.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,800
Can a kind of shellfish only form one meridian body?

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,200
Natural pearls may also have multiple grains

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,000
Just because it's rare doesn't mean there's only one

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,100
What? There’s a second pill?

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,140
Where is the other grain?

9
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,700
Take it out and have a look

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,130
Just watch it

11
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:25,530
I have no intention of hiding it

12
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:30,280
The samples here were originally reserved for joint testing.

13
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:33,880
Write ownership detection rights and subsequent benefits into the agreement

14
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:45,260
Only in the future will the auction house have stable rules to raise funds

15
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,060
Although there is a second pill

16
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:51,760
But you shouldn’t let the first pill be taken out of the country by foreigners.

17
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,160
Captain Wu

18
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,280
I've said it repeatedly before

19
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:57,080
I didn't dig this thing out at all.
